"```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang=\"en\">
<head>
    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">
    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">
    <title>Youssef vs. Adam: Egyptian Science Showdown!</title>
    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>
    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600;700@COMMENT_BODY@family=Nunito:wght@600;800@COMMENT_BODY@display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6d365 0%, #fda085 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            user-select: none;
        }
        h1, h2, h3, .title-font {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
        }
        .fire-border {
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.6), 0 0 40px rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.4);
            animation: pulseFire 1.5s infinite alternate;
        }
        @keyframes pulseFire {
            from { box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.5); }
            to { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.9), 0 0 50px rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.7); }
        }
        .shake {
            animation: shakeAnim 0.4s ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes shakeAnim {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
            25% { transform: translateX(-8px); }
            50% { transform: translateX(8px); }
            75% { transform: translateX(-8px); }
        }
        .bounce-in {
            animation: bounceIn 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.68, -0.55, 0.265, 1.55);
        }
        @keyframes bounceIn {
            0% { transform: scale(0.5); opacity: 0; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .btn-3d {
            transition: all 0.1s ease;
            border-bottom-width: 5px;
        }
        .btn-3d:active {
            transform: translateY(3px);
            border-bottom-width: 2px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class=\"p-2 md:p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">

    <!-- Header @COMMENT_BODY@ Navigation -->
    <div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-3xl shadow-2xl p-4 md:p-6 border-4 border-amber-500\">
        <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 border-b-2 border-amber-200 pb-4 mb-4\">
            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">
                <span class=\"text-4xl\">🔥</span>
                <div>
                    <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-amber-800 tracking-wide\">YOUSSEF vs. ADAM</h1>
                    <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-orange-600\">Primary 4 Science: Soil, Water @COMMENT_BODY@ Ancient Egypt!</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Mode Switcher Tabs -->
            <div class=\"flex gap-2\">
                <button onclick=\"switchTab('game')\" id=\"tab-game\" class=\"btn-3d px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold bg-orange-500 text-white border-orange-700 hover:bg-orange-600 cursor-pointer\">
                    🎮 Play 2-Player Battle
                </button>
                <button onclick=\"switchTab('prompt')\" id=\"tab-prompt\" class=\"btn-3d px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 border-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-200 cursor-pointer\">
                    🤖 AI Game Maker Code
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB 1: THE 2-PLAYER GAME -->
        <div id=\"view-game\" class=\"w-full\">

            <!-- Scoreboard -->
            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">
                <!-- Youssef Card -->
                <div id=\"card-youssef\" class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 text-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-lg flex items-center justify-between transition-all\">
                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">
                        <div class=\"text-4xl bg-white/20 p-2 rounded-xl\">🧑‍🔬</div>
                        <div>
                            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold\">YOUSSEF</h2>

---
This is a build request. Build a complete, playable game now (or apply the requested change to the existing game). Do not ask clarifying questions; make reasonable assumptions and note them briefly when you finish.

Screenshots for your own checks: save small JPEGs (a .jpg path, viewport at most 1280px wide) and read only the latest one; older images are dropped from context. Read a full-size PNG only when fine detail matters.
"

